      "tag": "Cultural Management · Exhibitions · Public Programmes · Service Design",
      "question": "How can a cultural space bring together art, heritage, ecology and social engagement?",
      "text": "BAYETAV Art opened in May 2023 in the Fernand Pagy Mansion, one of the few remaining 19th-century Levantine mansions in İzmir: a public meeting place where artistic practices, academic research and cultural programmes come together around the idea of living together. I joined as the space was opening, first as Venue and Events Manager and later as Design and Experience Strategist, and stayed until July 2024. I often think of BAYETAV Art as my second school.",
