      "tag": "Collaborative UI/UX · Accessibility",
      "question": "How might people experience a city beyond what they can see?",
      "text": "A mobile experience designed for and with visually impaired and blind people, turning textures into sound and guiding them through cultural and historical places. With İzmir Tarih, İzmir Municipality and Vestel's UX team.",
