      "id": "cologne",
      "title": "Customer Centers of the Future",
      "year": "2025",
      "lenses": [
        "systems",
        "visual"
      ],
      "tag": "Service Design · KISD × Stadt Köln (Stadtklar)",
      "question": "How do people feel about bureaucracy before they even arrive?",
      "text": "A team project with the City of Cologne, researching and redesigning services for the Kundenzentrum. The research focused on the digital appointment system, digitalisation and data privacy: how citizens emotionally navigate bureaucracy and information systems before they reach a public office. A comparative analysis of Germany's fragmented bureaucracy and Türkiye's centralised e-Devlet system showed how differently societies negotiate trust and security.",
      "role": "Service design research, UI/UX, data visualisation (team project)",
      "featured": false,
      "context_line": "A service design project with the City of Cologne at KISD, 2025.",
